<body>
    <h1>GPFS Commands to work with Pixstore</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h1 id=3D"GPFSCommandstoworkwithPixstore-EverydayCommands">Everyday=
 Commands</h1>
<h2 id=3D"GPFSCommandstoworkwithPixstore-CheckGPFSState">Check GPFS State</=
h2>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">/usr/lp=
p/mmfs/bin/mmgetstate -a
</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p>Shows the state of all nodes in the GPFS cluster.</p>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"GPFSCommandstoworkwithPixstore-StartGPFS">Start GPFS</h2>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">/usr/lp=
p/mmfs/bin/mmstartup -a
</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p>Starts GPFS on all nodes.</p>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"GPFSCommandstoworkwithPixstore-MountFilesystem">Mount Filesystem<=
/h2>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">/usr/lp=
p/mmfs/bin/mmmount mmfs1 -a
</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p>Mounts the <code>mmfs1</code> filesystem across all nodes.</p>
<p>Check mount:</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">/usr/lp=
p/mmfs/bin/mmlsmount mmfs1
</pre>
</div>
</div>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"GPFSCommandstoworkwithPixstore-VerifyMountedFilesystem">Verify Mo=
unted Filesystem</h2>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">df -h |=
 grep mmfs
</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p>Shows mounted GPFS filesystems and usage.</p>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"GPFSCommandstoworkwithPixstore-Node-SpecificOperations">Node-Spec=
ific Operations</h2>
<h3 id=3D"GPFSCommandstoworkwithPixstore-CheckGPFSstateforasinglenode">Chec=
k GPFS state for a single node</h3>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">/usr/lp=
p/mmfs/bin/mmgetstate -N &lt;node-name&gt;
</pre>
</div>
</div>
<h3 id=3D"GPFSCommandstoworkwithPixstore-Mountmmfs1onasinglenode">Mount <co=
de>mmfs1</code> on a single node</h3>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">/usr/lp=
p/mmfs/bin/mmmount mmfs1 -N &lt;node-name&gt;
</pre>
</div>
</div>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"GPFSCommandstoworkwithPixstore-SSH&amp;KnownHostsManagement">SSH =
&amp; Known Hosts Management</h2>
<h3 id=3D"GPFSCommandstoworkwithPixstore-ClearandRefreshSSHKeys">Clear and =
Refresh SSH Keys</h3>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">for h i=
n per-ai alt-mn-001.pixstor alt-sn-001.pixstor alt-gw-001.pixstor alt-ng-00=
1.pixstor alt-nvme-001.pixstor \
         127.0.1.1 10.100.0.1 10.100.0.2 10.100.0.3 10.100.0.4 10.100.0.5 ;=
 do
  ssh-keygen -R "$h" &gt;/dev/null 2&gt;&amp;1 || true
done

ssh-keyscan -H per-ai alt-mn-001.pixstor alt-sn-001.pixstor alt-gw-001.pixs=
tor alt-ng-001.pixstor alt-nvme-001.pixstor \
             10.100.0.1 10.100.0.2 10.100.0.3 10.100.0.4 10.100.0.5 &gt;&gt=
; ~/.ssh/known_hosts
</pre>
</div>
</div>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"GPFSCommandstoworkwithPixstore-QuickFilesystemAccess">Quick Files=
ystem Access</h2>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">ls -lah=
 /mmfs1
ls -lah /mmfs1/data
ls -lah /mmfs1/data/space01
</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p>Use these to validate access and contents of the Pixit filesystem.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
